OL,3,GNEWSADover Castle and its headless
OL,4,Adrummer boy
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Sometimes it seems to be that he is
OL,7,Fseen, but more usually heard, before
OL,8,Ftimes of great threat or drama," Wright
OL,9,Fsaid.
